2. MAJOR â€” spike.css:2 `.copy` vs `.daily` â€” heading "DAY COUNT." collides with the sheet top edge (period sits under the paper) from 65% to 100% and in reduced motion. Shots: desk-065, desk-080, desk-100, reduced-000.
